:''For the other Illya from the same Gacha, see [[Illyasviel (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Illya the Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 372
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Illya the Cat
|name2 = Snow Faerie Illya
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Snow Faerie Illya''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit has little use, easily being outclassed by the [[True Form]] of [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Enchantress Cat]] for [[Slow|slowing]] [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies, and most other [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-controllers]] for Red enemies outperforming Illya in her niche as well.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

